Name:Rules pilot 425 - Keep the Treasure for metalcraft
Goal:Survive
Turns:1
Difficulty:Hard
Description:It is your first main phase. You control Memnite (summoning sick) and a Treasure token, and have Galvanic Blast (2 damage to any target; metalcraft: 4 instead if you control three or more artifacts) and Ornithopter in hand, with one red mana floating. The opponent is at 4 life and controls no creatures. Reduce the opponent to 0 life this turn.
Rule:authored-metalcraft-treasure-count | A Treasure token is an artifact (CR 111.10a) and metalcraft counts artifacts as the spell resolves (CR 207.2c, 608.2h): cast Ornithopter, pay for Galvanic Blast with the floating red, and three artifacts make it deal 4; sacrificing the Treasure for mana leaves only two and 2 damage
